WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:22.010
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:22.280 --> 00:22.770
Hao,

3
00:23.680 --> 00:25.220
you've drained yourself lately

4
00:25.280 --> 00:26.100
repairing the talisman.

5
00:26.280 --> 00:27.660
Now you must ripen the Hollow Fruit.

6
00:27.790 --> 00:28.700
I've prepared some

7
00:28.700 --> 00:29.540
medicine to restore your energy.

8
00:29.670 --> 00:31.330
I hope it will help.

9
00:31.990 --> 00:32.410
Thank you.

10
00:37.480 --> 00:38.050
Is there anything else?

11
00:38.920 --> 00:40.090
At the recent sect assembly,

12
00:40.520 --> 00:41.580
Zhiwei showed no respect for tradition.

13
00:41.990 --> 00:42.940
He even dared to challenge you

14
00:43.070 --> 00:44.180
for leadership of the sect.

15
00:44.800 --> 00:46.860
He openly criticized you, too.

16
00:47.480 --> 00:48.580
He has sinister intentions.

17
00:49.630 --> 00:50.460
You must be wary of him.

18
00:52.560 --> 00:53.860
The leadership of Mount Zhaowu

19
00:54.280 --> 00:54.970
rightfully belongs to you.

20
00:57.390 --> 00:58.330
If there's nothing urgent,

21
00:58.600 --> 00:59.290
please leave.

22
01:00.070 --> 01:00.940
I'm rather tired.

23
01:03.430 --> 01:03.980
Hao.

24
01:04.520 --> 01:05.450
Get some rest, then.

25
01:39.190 --> 01:40.060
What is it now?

26
01:43.390 --> 01:44.110
What brings you here?

27
02:05.060 --> 02:10.940
♪Winds rise. Youth fades. Joy and sorrow turn to nothing♪

28
02:12.980 --> 02:18.940
♪Blossoms fade away. This fleeting life is but a dream♪

29
02:19.980 --> 02:24.220
♪Desire blinds my eyes♪

30
02:27.900 --> 02:35.460
♪Our paths now part, and I cannot make you stay♪

31
02:35.820 --> 02:42.580
♪If love is deadly poison, hate is a furnace that sears the heart♪

32
02:43.820 --> 02:50.460
♪What is devotion? I fool my heart and spin my own cocoon♪

33
02:51.660 --> 02:58.500
♪Anger, obsession, greed, resentment, and envy bring trials across lifetimes♪

34
03:00.100 --> 03:06.620
♪The past turns to dust. I regret nothing, though my love was misplaced♪

35
03:11.380 --> 03:13.180
[Blossom in Darkness]

36
03:13.180 --> 03:15.180
[Based on the novel "Blossom in Darkness" by Guo Guo]

37
03:15.180 --> 03:18.180
[Episode 12]

38
03:24.200 --> 03:24.770
I've noticed

39
03:24.770 --> 03:26.240
you haven't been yourself

40
03:26.240 --> 03:27.380
since you received the Hollow Fruit.

41
03:27.760 --> 03:28.620
Hao,

42
03:29.800 --> 03:31.060
do you not want to lead the sect?

43
03:34.990 --> 03:36.340
My master has high hopes for me.

44
03:37.150 --> 03:38.220
If he decides to retire,

45
03:38.480 --> 03:39.780
I must take on that responsibility

46
03:39.960 --> 03:40.850
and live up to his expectations.

47
03:43.800 --> 03:44.250
Yamao.

48
03:46.050 --> 03:46.530
You...

49
03:49.040 --> 03:50.490
You're avoiding the question

50
03:50.760 --> 03:52.180
because deep down, you don't want to.

51
03:54.480 --> 03:56.220
You secretly watched me last night

52
03:57.960 --> 03:59.940
because you're afraid that once I leave Mount Zhaowu,

53
04:00.590 --> 04:01.620
I'll never come back.

54
04:02.240 --> 04:02.850
Am I right?

55
04:12.360 --> 04:14.180
Mount Zhaowu never changes.

56
04:15.320 --> 04:16.420
It's terribly dull.

57
04:17.390 --> 04:18.740
Why not follow your heart

58
04:19.120 --> 04:20.250
and come with me?

59
04:22.230 --> 04:23.180
I'll show you

60
04:23.200 --> 04:24.500
all the wonders this world has to offer.

61
04:25.390 --> 04:27.010
More breathtaking than last night's dazzling silver blossoms.

62
04:27.270 --> 04:28.540
A hundred times more exciting!

63
04:29.680 --> 04:30.690
Hao,

64
04:31.230 --> 04:32.420
are you really willing

65
04:32.680 --> 04:34.130
to be trapped by the Path of Detachment?

66
04:34.760 --> 04:35.860
I... I...

67
04:39.470 --> 04:40.400
Mastering the immortal arts

68
04:41.150 --> 04:42.320
and protecting all living beings

69
04:42.760 --> 04:43.890
is the path I've chosen.

70
04:52.590 --> 04:53.860
You're lying.

71
04:55.350 --> 04:57.300
If your mind were truly free of distractions,

72
04:57.680 --> 04:59.330
how could I have taken your spiritual mark?

73
05:00.320 --> 05:01.300
Hao,

74
05:02.270 --> 05:02.940
I want you

75
05:02.960 --> 05:04.210
to stay by my side forever.

76
05:08.520 --> 05:09.330
Will you?

77
05:35.120 --> 05:36.060
A Soul Projection Talisman?

78
05:42.910 --> 05:44.740
How could I fall for such a cheap trick?

79
05:45.640 --> 05:46.420
And yet, in my heart,

80
05:49.640 --> 05:51.100
I conjured up an image of her.

81
05:56.320 --> 05:57.180
Yuwen Hao,

82
05:59.390 --> 06:01.010
you can barely call yourself human now.

83
06:02.520 --> 06:03.890
How can you lead the sect?

84
06:21.470 --> 06:23.180
At today's Mount Zhaowu assembly,

85
06:23.960 --> 06:25.830
did something happen?

86
06:28.150 --> 06:29.660
Mount Zhaowu is getting a new leader.

87
06:33.320 --> 06:34.740
Du Zhong

88
06:35.120 --> 06:36.510
has been leading the sect just fine.

89
06:37.910 --> 06:39.690
Why would he suddenly step down?

90
06:42.640 --> 06:43.570
He's attaining immortality and ascending.

91
06:44.440 --> 06:45.570
Retreating from the world.

92
06:53.030 --> 06:53.890
I never thought

93
06:54.710 --> 06:56.570
he'd truly attain immortality.

94
06:59.880 --> 07:01.100
Perhaps it's for the best.

95
07:02.150 --> 07:02.770
Now,

96
07:04.520 --> 07:06.060
I won't have to

97
07:06.080 --> 07:07.530
make him Soul-Soothing Porridge anymore.

98
07:49.140 --> 07:52.620
[Qingnian Residence]

99
08:04.230 --> 08:04.860
Come out.

100
08:10.230 --> 08:11.330
I knew it.

101
08:11.330 --> 08:12.260
You knew I was here.

102
08:12.350 --> 08:13.090
You should've said something.

103
08:13.230 --> 08:13.860
Then I wouldn't have bothered hiding.

104
08:16.000 --> 08:16.810
What are you doing here?

105
08:17.590 --> 08:19.490
Weren't we going to find some malice for you?

106
08:20.100 --> 08:21.100
Why'd you come all the way here?

107
08:23.270 --> 08:24.540
Something doesn't feel right.

108
08:27.790 --> 08:29.060
What seems wrong to you?

109
08:29.760 --> 08:30.980
Is it something about this place,

110
08:31.560 --> 08:32.450
or

111
08:32.990 --> 08:34.140
is it Uncle Du?

112
08:50.590 --> 08:52.150
What a maze of twists and turns.

113
08:52.400 --> 08:53.610
I had no idea Mount Zhaowu

114
08:53.630 --> 08:55.060
had such a strange place hidden away.

115
10:25.990 --> 10:28.180
You cultivators are ridiculous.

116
10:28.960 --> 10:29.940
You keep saying

117
10:30.200 --> 10:32.210
you want to protect the people,

118
10:32.710 --> 10:34.970
yet you've built a pool of blood in secret.

119
10:35.400 --> 10:36.260
Who knows how many living people

120
10:36.280 --> 10:37.690
were sacrificed to create that thing?

121
10:38.200 --> 10:39.490
And that thing he was holding...

122
10:40.200 --> 10:41.660
It looked like a life-tracking stone.

123
10:41.870 --> 10:43.210
Every disciple receives one

124
10:43.230 --> 10:44.660
when they join an immortal sect.

125
10:44.800 --> 10:45.850
It's enchanted.

126
10:46.110 --> 10:47.060
We place a drop of our blood on it.

127
10:47.200 --> 10:48.490
If anything happens to us,

128
10:48.680 --> 10:49.850
our sect will know

129
10:50.160 --> 10:51.330
whether to retrieve our body

130
10:51.590 --> 10:52.450
or come to our rescue.

131
10:52.750 --> 10:54.300
Could his so-called ascension

132
10:55.110 --> 10:56.380
actually involve using this dark art

133
10:57.080 --> 10:58.490
to cultivate his life-tracking stone?

134
11:01.320 --> 11:02.300
Did you see it just now?

135
11:02.800 --> 11:03.450
Your malice...

136
11:04.960 --> 11:05.730
It's inside him.

137
11:06.510 --> 11:07.690
But we can't take it by force.

138
11:08.920 --> 11:10.110
How could Uncle Du

139
11:10.110 --> 11:10.810
do something like this?

140
11:11.080 --> 11:12.330
He's my master's closest friend.

141
11:12.680 --> 11:14.420
Hao has always looked up to him.

142
11:14.560 --> 11:15.570
I just can't believe

143
11:15.570 --> 11:16.610
what we saw tonight.

144
11:16.920 --> 11:18.540
Whether you believe it or not,

145
11:18.540 --> 11:19.570
what difference does it make?

146
11:20.040 --> 11:21.300
Your master loses a friend.

147
11:21.840 --> 11:23.320
Yuwen Hao loses a role model.

148
11:23.800 --> 11:24.750
Does that mean

149
11:24.750 --> 11:25.970
the whole world is falling apart?

150
11:27.830 --> 11:28.880
You really don't know

151
11:28.880 --> 11:29.730
how to comfort someone, do you?

152
11:30.960 --> 11:32.220
I just don't understand

153
11:32.960 --> 11:34.650
why you'd let someone like him

154
11:36.440 --> 11:37.730
ruin your mood.

155
11:39.960 --> 11:41.100
Because when someone betrays your trust,

156
11:42.440 --> 11:44.130
of course it hurts.

157
11:45.750 --> 11:47.010
I was feeling pretty upset,

158
11:47.220 --> 11:48.020
but after listening to you,

159
11:48.020 --> 11:49.050
I don't even feel like being upset anymore.

160
11:49.080 --> 11:50.050
You shouldn't

161
11:50.050 --> 11:51.160
waste your feelings

162
11:51.160 --> 11:52.130
on people who don't matter.

163
11:57.120 --> 11:58.580
I'll talk to Hao tomorrow

164
11:59.630 --> 12:00.580
and find out

165
12:00.720 --> 12:02.100
what else Du Zhong has been up to.

166
12:02.630 --> 12:04.490
Someone who has deceived the entire world

167
12:04.840 --> 12:05.700
can't just be allowed

168
12:05.720 --> 12:06.430
to ascend like nothing happened.

169
12:07.910 --> 12:08.460
Let's go.

170
12:14.300 --> 12:17.100
[Mount Zhaowu]

171
12:41.120 --> 12:43.010
The Five Great Sects' combined efforts really worked wonders.

172
12:43.750 --> 12:44.460
This talisman

173
12:44.870 --> 12:46.250
should be fully restored in a few days.

174
12:49.030 --> 12:50.130
Thank you, esteemed sect leaders.

175
12:55.630 --> 12:56.400
Thank you, Uncle Du,

176
12:56.400 --> 12:57.700
for arranging this for my master.

177
12:57.930 --> 12:58.930
I'm truly grateful.

178
13:00.180 --> 13:02.340
The Devil Incarnate's rampage delayed things.

179
13:02.870 --> 13:03.890
Saving your master

180
13:04.200 --> 13:05.010
is the least I could do.

181
13:05.240 --> 13:05.890
There's no need to thank me.

182
13:09.000 --> 13:09.650
Uncle Du,

183
13:10.080 --> 13:11.300
there's something personal

184
13:11.360 --> 13:12.850
I'd like to discuss with Hao alone.

185
13:18.720 --> 13:19.060
All right.

186
13:19.720 --> 13:20.180
I'll leave you two to talk.

187
13:28.320 --> 13:29.010
Hao.

188
13:30.870 --> 13:31.890
Hao.

189
13:34.480 --> 13:35.650
Did you sleep poorly last night?

190
13:35.790 --> 13:36.730
You look awful.

191
13:38.390 --> 13:38.940
I'm fine.

192
13:40.600 --> 13:41.700
You don't look fine.

193
13:42.080 --> 13:43.370
You have dark circles under your eyes.

194
13:43.670 --> 13:44.730
You're lying.

195
13:46.440 --> 13:48.220
If your mind were truly free of distractions,

196
13:48.790 --> 13:50.460
how could I have taken your spiritual mark?

197
13:51.270 --> 13:52.130
Lately...

198
13:53.510 --> 13:54.980
With my master retiring and ascending,

199
13:55.360 --> 13:56.650
I've been chosen as his successor.

200
13:56.670 --> 13:58.100
Preparing for the trials has been exhausting.

201
13:58.670 --> 13:59.530
Then, Hao,

202
13:59.550 --> 14:00.460
what exactly are you struggling with?

203
14:00.480 --> 14:01.370
I want you to stay

204
14:01.390 --> 14:02.180
by my side forever.

205
14:02.200 --> 14:02.770
Maybe I can

206
14:02.790 --> 14:03.620
help you figure it out.

207
14:03.620 --> 14:04.660
Just say yes.

208
14:04.840 --> 14:06.940
There's also something I want to ask you...

209
14:07.060 --> 14:07.940
Will you?

210
14:08.030 --> 14:08.770
About Master Du...

211
14:08.790 --> 14:09.420
There's no need.

212
14:26.080 --> 14:27.610
Why don't we use powers?

213
14:28.840 --> 14:29.610
No.

214
14:30.030 --> 14:31.610
All Five Great Sects are here at Mount Zhaowu.

215
14:31.960 --> 14:33.060
If they sense your dark energy,

216
14:33.080 --> 14:33.650
we're finished.

217
14:34.550 --> 14:36.100
We're all helping you, aren't we?

218
14:36.510 --> 14:37.340
Just hang in there a few more days.

219
14:40.440 --> 14:41.060
Duyao,

220
14:41.080 --> 14:42.580
can't you use your powers?

221
14:42.790 --> 14:44.490
I like chopping wood with Big Brother.

222
14:51.120 --> 14:51.850
Now Yuwen Hao

223
14:51.870 --> 14:52.940
avoids me at every turn.

224
14:53.270 --> 14:54.490
I can barely even see him,

225
14:54.720 --> 14:55.650
much less get him to find out

226
14:55.670 --> 14:56.700
where Du Zhong is.

227
14:56.720 --> 14:57.460
When he tried to dig out

228
14:57.480 --> 14:58.130
your herb core,

229
14:58.150 --> 14:59.370
I knew something was wrong.

230
14:59.870 --> 15:00.700
I'm telling you,

231
15:00.870 --> 15:01.490
that old cultivator

232
15:01.510 --> 15:03.060
may look like an honorable man,

233
15:03.150 --> 15:04.730
but he's rotten to the core.

234
15:05.080 --> 15:06.010
Maybe when he tried

235
15:06.030 --> 15:07.180
to awaken the Saintess of the Tides,

236
15:07.480 --> 15:08.770
he wasn't trying to defeat demons at all.

237
15:11.790 --> 15:14.340
Maybe he just wanted to use her divine power

238
15:14.480 --> 15:15.250
to achieve immortality.

239
15:15.510 --> 15:16.530
You'd better be careful.

240
15:17.080 --> 15:18.530
I think he's still after your herb core.

241
15:18.750 --> 15:19.340
Impossible.

242
15:20.390 --> 15:21.850
If he really wanted my herb core,

243
15:21.910 --> 15:22.700
why would he agree

244
15:22.720 --> 15:23.530
to help save my master?

245
15:24.240 --> 15:25.460
I'm sure I'm not his target.

246
15:26.030 --> 15:26.700
Believe what you want.

247
15:28.000 --> 15:28.460
Duyao,

248
15:29.000 --> 15:30.370
you came to life from Du Zhong's artifact.

249
15:30.670 --> 15:31.770
Do you know something?

250
15:32.480 --> 15:34.220
After I was brought to Mount Zhaowu,

251
15:35.000 --> 15:35.850
he and I

252
15:36.390 --> 15:37.300
used this golden seal

253
15:37.320 --> 15:38.530
to make a pact.

254
15:38.790 --> 15:39.920
He said I'd have to help him

255
15:39.920 --> 15:40.850
with something someday.

256
15:41.720 --> 15:42.700
Once it was done,

257
15:42.790 --> 15:43.490
he would tell me

258
15:43.510 --> 15:44.700
the truth about my origins.

259
15:47.960 --> 15:48.940
The truth about your origins?

260
15:50.030 --> 15:50.770
Aren't you

261
15:50.790 --> 15:51.890
a spirit born from Du Zhong's artifact?

262
16:00.840 --> 16:02.220
That mark won't come off.

263
16:05.200 --> 16:06.530
I wonder what

264
16:06.550 --> 16:07.130
he wants you to do.

265
16:07.360 --> 16:08.820
Could it put you in danger?

266
16:10.670 --> 16:11.340
Anyway,

267
16:12.150 --> 16:12.850
for now,

268
16:13.150 --> 16:14.220
stay close to us.

269
16:14.270 --> 16:14.980
Don't wander off.

270
16:15.630 --> 16:15.980
Okay.

271
16:17.120 --> 16:18.130
I know someone

272
16:18.550 --> 16:19.980
who might know something about Du Zhong.

273
16:20.480 --> 16:21.250
I'll go ask him now.

274
16:38.960 --> 16:40.060
Why are you running?

275
16:40.630 --> 16:41.400
Come back.

276
16:43.240 --> 16:43.960
We've

277
16:43.960 --> 16:45.100
helped each other a few times.

278
16:45.320 --> 16:46.370
Doesn't that make us friends?

279
16:46.790 --> 16:47.580
You little...

280
16:49.080 --> 16:49.610
Mighty demon.

281
16:49.910 --> 16:50.730
Hiding on Mount Zhaowu

282
16:50.790 --> 16:51.820
is incredibly dangerous.

283
16:52.390 --> 16:53.850
I've warned you so many times, but you won't listen.

284
16:54.360 --> 16:55.770
I don't want to deal with you anymore.

285
16:58.640 --> 16:59.770
I have a name.

286
17:00.270 --> 17:01.010
It's Youyou.

287
17:04.070 --> 17:04.490
Youyou?

288
17:07.790 --> 17:08.380
Youyou,

289
17:08.720 --> 17:10.940
you really shouldn't be wandering around the mountain.

290
17:11.240 --> 17:12.660
But there's something important

291
17:12.680 --> 17:13.490
I need your help with.

292
17:14.880 --> 17:16.660
Remember when you were poisoned by that toxic miasma?

293
17:16.880 --> 17:17.980
I went to great lengths

294
17:17.980 --> 17:18.930
to save your life.

295
17:19.160 --> 17:20.380
You owe me your life.

296
17:24.220 --> 17:24.570
Come on!

297
17:30.160 --> 17:30.900
I saved your life!

298
17:49.160 --> 17:50.570
- I saved your life... - All right, all right!

299
17:52.160 --> 17:52.860
Calm down.

300
17:53.680 --> 17:54.330
As long as

301
17:54.440 --> 17:55.940
you're not asking me to do anything illegal,

302
17:56.030 --> 17:56.660
and it's within

303
17:56.880 --> 17:58.250
my abilities,

304
17:58.510 --> 17:59.620
I'll gladly help you.

305
18:00.400 --> 18:00.940
Really?

306
18:01.880 --> 18:02.940
Then I want to know

307
18:03.240 --> 18:04.900
about your sect leader's past.

308
18:05.070 --> 18:06.210
Has he ever done

309
18:06.210 --> 18:06.850
anything wrong?

310
18:06.850 --> 18:07.440
- How dare you... - Or...

311
18:08.480 --> 18:09.700
How dare you speak ill of our master?

312
18:10.030 --> 18:10.770
Isn't he

313
18:10.790 --> 18:11.860
about to fly up into the sky?

314
18:12.000 --> 18:12.940
- You... - Ascend.

315
18:13.550 --> 18:15.140
I just want to know how he did it.

316
18:16.160 --> 18:17.700
Our master is a man of great integrity.

317
18:17.750 --> 18:18.940
He protects the innocent and defeats demons.

318
18:19.510 --> 18:20.810
He's never done anything evil.

319
18:21.550 --> 18:22.330
Over the years,

320
18:22.510 --> 18:23.660
apart from a few ungrateful disciples

321
18:23.750 --> 18:24.770
who betrayed and framed him,

322
18:26.070 --> 18:27.290
he's always treated us well.

323
18:28.000 --> 18:29.180
What ungrateful disciples?

324
18:29.350 --> 18:30.460
Betrayed him? Framed him?

325
18:33.070 --> 18:34.420
Remember when you were poisoned by that toxic miasma...?

326
18:36.270 --> 18:37.140
All right, all right.

327
18:38.000 --> 18:39.920
I know you saved my life.

328
18:41.920 --> 18:42.960
Although this matter

329
18:42.960 --> 18:44.160
isn't exactly a secret,

330
18:44.240 --> 18:45.940
it's still a scandal at Mount Zhaowu.

331
18:46.830 --> 18:48.160
It's not something we like to discuss.

332
18:49.720 --> 18:51.010
But I did promise

333
18:51.070 --> 18:51.980
to help you.

334
18:55.550 --> 18:55.940
Youyou,

335
18:57.030 --> 18:57.860
you must promise me

336
18:58.270 --> 18:59.150
that you absolutely

337
18:59.650 --> 19:01.180
won't tell anyone about this.

338
19:05.440 --> 19:06.320
I'm telling you,

339
19:06.320 --> 19:07.680
it's absolutely unbelievable!

340
19:07.680 --> 19:08.660
It's shocking!

341
19:09.640 --> 19:11.240
Something happened at Mount Zhaowu

342
19:11.240 --> 19:12.570
that caused a huge scandal.

343
19:14.070 --> 19:14.860
Did you know

344
19:15.400 --> 19:17.330
Yuwen Hao actually wasn't

345
19:17.350 --> 19:18.860
Du Zhong's only personal disciple?

346
19:19.000 --> 19:19.620
Before him,

347
19:19.640 --> 19:20.620
Du Zhong had two other disciples.

348
19:20.720 --> 19:22.900
One of them was a woman.

349
19:23.070 --> 19:24.200
A woman?

350
19:26.680 --> 19:29.280
Mount Zhaowu has always accepted only male disciples.

351
19:29.750 --> 19:30.900
Even I only got in

352
19:30.920 --> 19:31.940
thanks to my master.

353
19:32.240 --> 19:33.180
And all I could do was sit in

354
19:33.200 --> 19:34.530
on a few beginner cultivation classes.

355
19:34.750 --> 19:35.940
Well, here's something you didn't know.

356
19:36.640 --> 19:37.900
Hao's senior fellow disciple

357
19:37.900 --> 19:39.380
was named Hua Changpu.

358
19:39.640 --> 19:40.220
She originally

359
19:40.240 --> 19:41.420
came from a humble family.

360
19:41.830 --> 19:42.920
Then bandits attacked their home,

361
19:42.960 --> 19:44.050
and her entire family was killed.

362
19:44.480 --> 19:45.410
Du Zhong happened to pass by

363
19:45.410 --> 19:46.110
and saved her.

364
19:46.160 --> 19:47.250
He saw that she was all alone

365
19:47.270 --> 19:48.290
and took pity on her.

366
19:48.400 --> 19:49.380
So he brought her to the mountain.

367
19:49.520 --> 19:50.900
Qingxing told me

368
19:50.900 --> 19:52.380
Du Zhong absolutely

369
19:52.380 --> 19:53.530
doted on her.

370
19:53.640 --> 19:55.050
He set aside the prettiest grove

371
19:55.110 --> 19:55.810
on the hill out back

372
19:55.830 --> 19:57.050
just for her to live in.

373
19:58.640 --> 19:59.330
But sadly,

374
19:59.590 --> 20:01.700
you never really know someone's true nature.

375
20:01.960 --> 20:03.050
Later, Hua Changpu

376
20:03.440 --> 20:05.110
joined forces with Mount Zhaowu's chief disciple

377
20:05.270 --> 20:06.570
