385
20:17.880 --> 20:19.170
It took him many years

386
20:19.200 --> 20:20.180
before he finally accepted

387
20:20.180 --> 20:21.530
Yuwen Hao as his only personal disciple.

388
20:23.160 --> 20:24.420
But Qingxing

389
20:24.440 --> 20:25.770
