390
20:26.160 --> 20:26.940
How would he know?

391
20:27.030 --> 20:28.250
The story was passed down.

392
20:28.510 --> 20:29.900
Hua Changpu

393
20:30.000 --> 20:31.050
betrayed the man who saved her.

394
20:31.110 --> 20:32.250
She was utterly ungrateful.

395
20:32.350 --> 20:33.530
Rotten to the core!

396
20:33.720 --> 20:34.860
That's why people kept talking

397
20:34.960 --> 20:35.810
about what happened.

398
20:35.960 --> 20:37.380
But later, Yuwen Hao

399
20:37.440 --> 20:38.090
forbade anyone from discussing it.

400
20:38.160 --> 20:39.330
Nobody dared mention it again.

401
20:40.200 --> 20:41.290
As far as I'm concerned,

402
20:41.510 --> 20:42.570
they were all just as bad as each other.

403
20:42.830 --> 20:43.980
Like disciple,

404
20:44.110 --> 20:45.460
like master.

405
20:48.160 --> 20:48.770
What do you think?

406
20:49.110 --> 20:50.660
That beautiful spot on the hill out back...

407
20:51.110 --> 20:52.980
