408
20:54.960 --> 20:56.140
That must be Qingjing Grove.

409
20:56.920 --> 20:58.220
It's a forbidden area now.

410
20:58.880 --> 20:59.780
No one except Du Zhong

411
20:59.780 --> 21:00.940
is allowed inside.

412
21:02.400 --> 21:03.210
Sounds like

413
21:03.210 --> 21:04.330
what happened with Hua Changpu

414
21:04.790 --> 21:05.770
must have

415
21:05.790 --> 21:06.700
