419
21:15.100 --> 21:18.510
[Forbidden Area]

420
21:18.510 --> 21:19.250
Forbidden area?

421
21:20.160 --> 21:21.380
So this is Qingjing Grove?

422
21:22.550 --> 21:23.220
But I didn't expect

423
21:23.240 --> 21:24.490
