429
21:45.750 --> 21:46.660
Perfect timing.

430
21:46.920 --> 21:48.490
I can't use my powers right now,

431
21:48.750 --> 21:50.730
and Qi Fengyin can't use his dark energy.

432
21:51.000 --> 21:51.380
So,

433
21:51.590 --> 21:52.530
you can break the barrier for us.

434
21:57.680 --> 21:58.250
Wait.

435
22:17.310 --> 22:18.460
If this place is forbidden,

436
22:18.920 --> 22:19.810
why is he coming here?

437
22:20.110 --> 22:20.810
That was close.

438
22:21.000 --> 22:21.940
If we'd gone straight in,

439
22:21.960 --> 22:23.140
Du Zhong would've caught us.

440
22:23.720 --> 22:25.860
So we're not going in now?

441
22:25.960 --> 22:27.090
Of course we're going.

442
22:27.350 --> 22:28.460
But we don't know

443
22:28.510 --> 22:29.730
when Du Zhong visits Qingjing Grove.

444
22:29.960 --> 22:30.900
I'll have to take my chances

445
22:30.920 --> 22:31.810
and go straight to Yuwen Hao.

446
22:48.400 --> 22:49.250
I've been busy

447
22:49.480 --> 22:50.220
preparing for my trials.

448
22:51.110 --> 22:52.010
I don't have time to keep you company.

449
22:52.720 --> 22:53.620
Please leave, Yamao.

450
22:54.880 --> 22:56.530
What did I ever do to upset you?

451
22:56.720 --> 22:58.050
You've been avoiding me lately.

452
22:58.400 --> 22:59.660
And you keep bringing up those trials.

453
23:04.110 --> 23:05.420
You haven't even planted your seed yet.

454
23:05.590 --> 23:06.570
What could be keeping you so busy?

455
23:06.790 --> 23:07.810
That's my personal business.

456
23:08.680 --> 23:09.570
It doesn't concern you.

457
23:23.550 --> 23:25.730
What did I ever do to you?

458
23:25.750 --> 23:26.660
Why do you hate me so much?

459
23:26.680 --> 23:27.730
I was wrong just now.

460
23:27.790 --> 23:28.770
I shouldn't have been so harsh.

461
23:34.960 --> 23:35.460
You...

462
23:36.720 --> 23:37.460
How childish!

463
23:39.060 --> 23:39.410
I...

464
23:39.410 --> 23:39.700
No...

465
23:43.270 --> 23:45.050
You never used to fall

466
23:45.050 --> 23:45.770
for my tricks so easily.

467
23:46.880 --> 23:47.890
What's gotten into you?

468
23:48.440 --> 23:49.730
Have you really been

469
23:49.750 --> 23:50.900
so caught up in

470
23:51.200 --> 23:52.490
the succession trial?

471
23:52.790 --> 23:54.180
You can stop beating around the bush.

472
23:55.030 --> 23:55.940
You've come looking for me several times.

473
23:56.240 --> 23:56.900
What do you really want?

474
24:07.310 --> 24:08.250
I want to know

475
24:09.510 --> 24:11.460
why no one

476
24:11.830 --> 24:12.980
is allowed into Qingjing Grove.

477
24:14.920 --> 24:15.460
You...

478
24:16.790 --> 24:18.050
Why are you asking about Qingjing Grove?

479
24:18.830 --> 24:20.050
It's forbidden ground at Mount Zhaowu.

480
24:22.480 --> 24:24.010
I went to the hill out back today

481
24:24.350 --> 24:26.090
and saw Uncle Du enter Qingjing Grove.

482
24:27.240 --> 24:29.090
Of all the sect leaders, only he's ascending.

483
24:29.880 --> 24:32.010
So naturally, I'm curious.

484
24:32.130 --> 24:33.810
I wondered if this grove

485
24:34.070 --> 24:35.490
holds some special secret.

486
24:45.160 --> 24:46.570
My master is terribly weak.

487
24:47.310 --> 24:49.180
Even if the talisman saves him,

488
24:49.510 --> 24:50.810
it may not cure his condition.

489
24:51.270 --> 24:52.090
So I thought,

490
24:52.480 --> 24:53.660
if Qingjing Grove

491
24:53.790 --> 24:54.810
really holds some secret,

492
24:55.070 --> 24:55.380
perhaps...

493
24:55.510 --> 24:56.220
Yamao,

494
24:57.720 --> 24:58.530
I'm afraid

495
24:59.070 --> 24:59.860
you'll be disappointed.

496
25:01.750 --> 25:02.700
There's nothing

497
25:02.750 --> 25:03.490
special about Qingjing Grove.

498
25:04.030 --> 25:05.700
Something happened there long ago,

499
25:06.550 --> 25:08.090
and my master still can't let it go.

500
25:09.070 --> 25:10.180
He visits Qingjing Grove

501
25:10.790 --> 25:11.900
only because he wants

502
25:12.200 --> 25:12.900
to face his past

503
25:13.240 --> 25:14.010
and find peace.

504
25:15.830 --> 25:16.380
Really?

505
25:17.000 --> 25:17.730
Why would I lie to you?

506
25:19.240 --> 25:21.460
All these years, besides my master,

507
25:23.000 --> 25:23.810
the only person allowed inside

508
25:23.830 --> 25:25.220
is Yeniang, who brings him Soul-Soothing Porridge.

509
25:25.590 --> 25:26.730
No one else can enter Qingjing Grove.

510
25:28.000 --> 25:29.620
Whenever my master eats the porridge,

511
25:29.880 --> 25:31.010
he falls into a deep sleep for hours.

512
25:31.680 --> 25:33.090
He doesn't want the disciples disturbing him.

513
25:33.790 --> 25:34.570
That's why he made it

514
25:34.720 --> 25:35.380
