515
25:36.550 --> 25:37.380
I see.

516
25:42.510 --> 25:43.910
He trusts Du Zhong so completely.

517
25:44.370 --> 25:45.900
If I tell him about the blood pool,

518
25:46.440 --> 25:47.450
