519
25:50.900 --> 25:51.700
Yamao?

520
25:53.070 --> 25:53.570
What's wrong?

521
25:56.270 --> 25:57.330
It would be

522
25:57.350 --> 25:58.330
too cruel to Hao.

523
25:59.270 --> 26:00.980
If he finds out I lied to him

524
26:01.200 --> 26:02.570
