526
26:18.310 --> 26:19.220
What are you doing?

527
26:20.310 --> 26:21.420
Helping you, of course.

528
26:22.200 --> 26:23.380
If you pass the trials,

529
26:23.680 --> 26:25.010
I'll have a sect leader as a friend

530
26:25.010 --> 26:25.700
to back me up.

531
26:25.920 --> 26:26.700
You don't need to help me.

532
26:28.240 --> 26:28.730
I still

533
26:31.310 --> 26:32.090
haven't made up my mind.

534
26:41.000 --> 26:41.490
All right.

535
26:42.270 --> 26:42.900
I won't push you.

536
26:43.830 --> 26:45.700
Whether you become sect leader

537
26:46.070 --> 26:46.900
is up to fate.

538
26:47.270 --> 26:48.420
Just think it through.

539
26:49.440 --> 26:50.730
Whatever you do,

540
26:51.000 --> 26:52.620
don't make a decision you'll regret for life.

541
27:19.720 --> 27:21.330
He's already had his Soul-Soothing Porridge.

542
27:22.640 --> 27:23.570
Du Zhong should

543
27:23.590 --> 27:24.250
be fast asleep by now.

544
27:24.350 --> 27:25.490
He won't wake up anytime soon.

545
27:37.000 --> 27:37.730
Got it.

546
27:50.310 --> 27:50.860
What's wrong?

547
27:51.110 --> 27:52.290
There's something strange

548
27:52.590 --> 27:53.620
