551
27:58.160 --> 27:59.660
That old sect lackey must've set this up.

552
27:59.880 --> 28:00.660
If anyone

553
28:00.680 --> 28:01.490
sneaks into the forbidden area,

554
28:01.550 --> 28:02.330
they won't be able to get out.

555
28:02.480 --> 28:03.570
He can trap them right here.

556
28:03.790 --> 28:04.530
Don't worry.

557
28:04.830 --> 28:06.140
I can keep it open from here.

558
28:06.400 --> 28:07.220
We'll be back as soon as we can.

559
28:08.110 --> 28:08.530
Youyou,

560
28:09.310 --> 28:09.980
stay here

561
28:10.000 --> 28:10.810
and keep watch for Duyao.

562
28:10.820 --> 28:11.420
All right.

563
28:11.590 --> 28:12.810
But you'd better hurry.

564
28:29.240 --> 28:29.660
Look over there.

565
28:34.640 --> 28:35.620
What's that mist?

566
28:36.680 --> 28:37.700
It looks familiar.

567
28:39.030 --> 28:40.180
It must be his stray thoughts.

568
28:41.440 --> 28:42.330
He's

569
28:43.160 --> 28:44.180
forcing those thoughts

570
28:44.200 --> 28:45.050
out of his body.

571
28:45.200 --> 28:46.730
But they haven't disappeared.

572
28:49.070 --> 28:50.180
He's kept them here,

573
28:51.160 --> 28:52.090
where they've formed flowers.

574
28:53.240 --> 28:53.860
Let's take a look.

575
29:03.640 --> 29:04.770
If we use this flower,

576
29:06.920 --> 29:08.810
we might see Du Zhong's inner demons.

577
29:30.640 --> 29:31.660
Father!

578
29:32.400 --> 29:33.530
Mother!

579
29:37.790 --> 29:38.730
Father!

580
29:39.830 --> 29:40.530
Mother!

581
29:45.790 --> 29:46.380
Don't go!

582
29:46.790 --> 29:47.810
None of this is real.

583
30:00.030 --> 30:00.330
No.

584
30:01.000 --> 30:02.050
Actually, it is real.

585
30:05.070 --> 30:06.290
This is Du Zhong's past.

586
30:23.180 --> 30:25.940
[Yan Shang, Chief Disciple of Mount Zhaowu]

587
30:27.790 --> 30:28.570
From this day forward,

588
30:29.240 --> 30:30.090
Hua Changpu

589
30:30.640 --> 30:31.730
is now officially

590
30:31.750 --> 30:32.810
a disciple of Mount Zhaowu

591
30:33.920 --> 30:35.770
and my personal disciple.

592
30:39.000 --> 30:39.980
You must never do evil

593
30:40.110 --> 30:40.980
or harbor evil thoughts.

594
30:41.240 --> 30:42.980
Only then can you stay healthy

595
30:42.980 --> 30:44.560
- Do evil? - and walk the immortal path.

596
30:44.560 --> 30:45.420
If these are all

597
30:45.440 --> 30:46.490
obsessions he wants to discard,

598
30:47.400 --> 30:49.010
why would he turn his memories

599
30:49.590 --> 30:50.980
of Hua Changpu into flowers?

600
30:53.880 --> 30:55.530
He wants to keep them, but he can't.

601
30:56.550 --> 30:57.660
That's why he chose this way

602
30:57.680 --> 30:58.380
to preserve them as memories.

603
31:00.640 --> 31:02.220
Du Zhong is a strange man.

604
31:02.830 --> 31:04.010
He wants to attain immortality,

605
31:04.550 --> 31:06.010
yet he can't let go of his past.

606
31:08.590 --> 31:10.140
This must be what Youyou meant

607
31:10.160 --> 31:11.380
by being a hypocrite.

608
31:14.920 --> 31:16.290
Could Hua Changpu

609
31:17.070 --> 31:18.290
be his true obsession?

610
31:59.400 --> 32:00.090
Why is Hua Changpu

611
32:00.160 --> 32:01.570
nothing like the rumors say?

612
32:02.200 --> 32:03.420
She's so sweet and innocent.

613
32:03.830 --> 32:04.730
How could she possibly

614
32:04.790 --> 32:06.010
betray her master like that?

615
32:06.790 --> 32:08.420
Everyone says Du Zhong is a good man.

616
32:09.160 --> 32:10.010
But look...

617
32:25.720 --> 32:26.490
Master.

618
32:30.030 --> 32:31.010
What is it

619
32:31.440 --> 32:32.860
you desire most in this life?

620
32:34.110 --> 32:36.350
All cultivators seek

621
32:36.400 --> 32:37.380
to attain immortality

622
32:37.550 --> 32:38.490
and protect the world.

623
32:40.200 --> 32:41.290
Aside from immortality,

624
32:42.440 --> 32:43.220
isn't there

625
32:43.510 --> 32:45.290
anything else that matters to you?

626
32:45.480 --> 32:46.530
My mind is made up.

627
33:11.200 --> 33:12.940
Hua Changpu wasn't in love with Yan Shang.

628
33:13.750 --> 33:14.460
She loved Du Zhong.

629
33:31.720 --> 33:33.290
Master has treated you so well,

630
33:33.920 --> 33:34.980
yet you harbor

631
33:35.000 --> 33:36.730
such shameful feelings for him.

632
33:37.680 --> 33:39.010
How disgusting.

633
33:39.550 --> 33:40.460
I don't.

634
33:40.880 --> 33:41.880
You still dare deny it?

635
33:41.880 --> 33:42.390
No.

636
33:43.240 --> 33:44.700
Do you think Master

637
33:45.550 --> 33:47.460
doesn't know how you feel?

638
33:51.270 --> 33:52.980
He told you?

639
33:54.680 --> 33:56.420
How could he reveal

640
33:56.680 --> 33:57.980
my feelings to someone else?

641
34:00.480 --> 34:02.570
So you do know what shame is.

642
34:03.830 --> 34:04.700
Hua Changpu,

643
34:05.790 --> 34:07.140
Master is devoted to the immortal path.

644
34:08.030 --> 34:09.980
He would never let your filthy desires

645
34:10.070 --> 34:11.260
taint his faith.

646
34:20.760 --> 34:22.010
Yan Shang is heartless.

647
34:23.440 --> 34:25.530
What does Du Zhong have to do with this?

648
34:38.110 --> 34:38.860
Changpu.

649
34:47.440 --> 34:48.090
You wretch!

650
34:49.030 --> 34:50.570
How dare you do this to her?

651
34:50.880 --> 34:51.490
Master.

652
34:52.440 --> 34:53.690
She has shaken your faith in the immortal path.

653
34:54.710 --> 34:56.260
She deserves

654
34:56.280 --> 34:57.490
death by 36 sword strikes!

655
35:10.320 --> 35:11.050
Du Zhong.

656
35:12.150 --> 35:14.380
You drove me to my death.

657
35:15.400 --> 35:18.170
I sacrifice all my cultivation and spiritual power.

658
35:19.360 --> 35:21.980
This wound will never heal.

659
35:22.550 --> 35:24.610
You will suffer from it

660
35:25.510 --> 35:27.610
and never attain immortality!

661
36:01.670 --> 36:03.050
Du Zhong was obsessed with attaining immortality.

662
36:03.440 --> 36:04.460
But Hua Changpu's curse

663
36:04.510 --> 36:05.260
made that impossible.

664
36:05.630 --> 36:06.690
That's his true obsession.

665
36:10.840 --> 36:11.780
It's too dangerous here.

666
36:12.150 --> 36:13.090
I'll get you out first.

667
36:15.110 --> 36:16.530
I know how to free him from his obsession.

668
36:32.230 --> 36:32.860
Qi Fengyin!

669
36:35.150 --> 36:35.860
Qi Fengyin!

670
36:56.800 --> 36:57.780
This is...

671
36:58.840 --> 37:00.380
The depths of Du Zhong's dream?

672
37:07.070 --> 37:08.340
My powers don't work here.

673
37:49.230 --> 37:51.090
I can't believe I failed to catch her.

674
38:31.150 --> 38:32.940
She must have fallen into the depths of the dream.

675
38:33.440 --> 38:34.170
To reach her,

676
38:34.710 --> 38:36.130
I'll have to make this dream

677
38:36.280 --> 38:37.300
split open again.

678
39:08.320 --> 39:09.570
Why does every path I take

679
39:10.000 --> 39:11.130
lead me right back here?

680
39:12.030 --> 39:13.420
Is there even a way out?

681
40:01.070 --> 40:01.940
Qi Fengyin?

682
40:11.070 --> 40:11.860
That was terrifying!

683
40:12.110 --> 40:13.530
I thought I'd be trapped here forever.

684
40:15.320 --> 40:16.260
So you do know fear.

685
40:18.760 --> 40:19.490
Well, not really.

686
40:19.670 --> 40:20.270
I knew

687
40:20.320 --> 40:21.490
you'd find me.

688
40:27.880 --> 40:28.740
Don't let go.

689
40:44.920 --> 40:45.900
Qi Fengyin is still alive?

690
40:46.590 --> 40:47.380
He already knows

691
40:47.400 --> 40:48.490
who I really am.

692
40:48.590 --> 40:49.860
How about we make a deal?

693
40:49.920 --> 40:51.050
You must make sure

694
40:51.360 --> 40:52.940
he loses to me

695
40:53.360 --> 40:54.170
at the succession assembly.

696
40:55.320 --> 40:57.300
Qi Fengyin has denied we're working together.

697
40:57.960 --> 40:59.010
If I just hold back now,

698
40:59.320 --> 41:00.780
everything can go back to the way it was.

699
41:01.360 --> 41:03.010
I'll just die again. So what?

700
41:23.620 --> 41:27.660
♪See this world where flowers have yet to bloom♪

701
41:27.900 --> 41:31.340
♪So many longings♪

702
41:32.020 --> 41:34.100
♪Linger in the web of fate♪

703
41:34.300 --> 41:39.300
♪Then vanish like mist in a moment♪

704
41:40.220 --> 41:44.260
♪Before seas turn to fields♪

705
41:44.500 --> 41:47.940
♪Dreams scatter across the sky♪

706
41:48.620 --> 41:50.700
♪One look into each other's eyes♪

707
41:50.900 --> 41:58.300
♪And we fall in love in an instant♪

708
41:59.700 --> 42:03.380
♪When a hundred thousand blossoms have withered♪

709
42:03.620 --> 42:07.300
♪I'll still want to stay with you like this forever♪

710
42:07.940 --> 42:11.500
♪The wish we made in the long night♪

711
42:11.820 --> 42:15.980
♪Still waits to come true♪

712
42:16.220 --> 42:19.900
♪However many hardships this vast world holds♪

713
42:20.460 --> 42:24.100
♪I'll stay by your side♪

714
42:24.580 --> 42:28.180
♪Love will grace our days till the end of time♪

715
42:28.420 --> 42:35.740
♪When the dream ends, we'll have no regrets♪

